    "created_at": "2026-04-21T15:34:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-21T15:34:51Z",
    "body": "So we have both nullable and optional to contend with. Do we want both TriState and NeedsNull? NeedsNull is also good for non-boolean cases which often have a similar issue.",
