    "created_at": "2026-04-21T15:46:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-21T15:47:27Z",
    "body": "But both are also kinda about not having default value, and having accidental `T?` also makes it tristate:\n\n1. T (well arguably this can have more states though)\n2. null\n3. undefined\n\nMaybe `[TriState]` can cover both? 🤔 (Or some better name)",
