    "created_at": "2026-04-21T18:57:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-21T18:57:07Z",
    "body": "Oh right, I was still thinking of the bool meaning. Maybe it can be like this: NeedsNull and NeedsNullAndUndefined. I don't think we want NeedsUndefined (without NeedsNull) as generally there are many legitimate cases for that, but maybe for bool we still want to require something for that. Could be TriState still I suppose.",
